  "title": "Question words",
  "teTitle": "ప్రశ్నలు",
  "cefr": "A1+",
  "register": "standard",
  "description": "Ask who, what, where, when, why, how, and how much — and answer back.",
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "u04-i01",
      "te": "ఆయన ఎవరు?",
      "gloss": "Who is he?",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఆయన", "gloss": "he (respectful)" },
        { "te": "ఎవరు", "gloss": "who" }
      ],
      "tags": ["questions", "people"],
      "difficulty": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "u04-i02",
      "te": "ఆయన మా మామయ్య.",
      "gloss": "He is my uncle.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఆయన", "gloss": "he (respectful)" },
        { "te": "మా", "gloss": "our / my (family)" },
        { "te": "మామయ్య", "gloss": "uncle (mother's brother)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["people", "family"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "note": "మామయ్య (maamayya) is your mother's brother — and also what you call your father-in-law!",
      "distractors": ["u04-i16", "u04-i01"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u04-i03",
      "te": "ఇది ఏంటి?",
      "gloss": "What is this?",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఇది", "gloss": "this" },
        { "te": "ఏంటి", "gloss": "what (spoken)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["questions", "things"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "note": "ఏమిటి (eemiTi) is the full form of 'what'; in everyday speech it becomes ఏంటి (eenTi), often glued on: ఇదేంటి?"
    },
    {
      "id": "u04-i04",
      "te": "ఇది నా ఫోన్.",
      "gloss": "This is my phone.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఇది", "gloss": "this" },
        { "te": "నా", "gloss": "my" },
        { "te": "ఫోన్", "gloss": "phone" }
      ],
      "tags": ["things"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "distractors": ["u04-i03", "u04-i14"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u04-i05",
      "te": "మీ ఇల్లు ఎక్కడ?",
      "gloss": "Where is your house?",
      "words": [
        { "te": "మీ", "gloss": "your (polite)" },
        { "te": "ఇల్లు", "gloss": "house" },
        { "te": "ఎక్కడ", "gloss": "where" }
      ],
      "tags": ["questions", "places"],
      "difficulty": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "u04-i06",
      "te": "మా ఇల్లు హైదరాబాదులో.",
      "gloss": "Our house is in Hyderabad.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "మా", "gloss": "our" },
        { "te": "ఇల్లు", "gloss": "house" },
        { "te": "హైదరాబాదులో", "gloss": "in Hyderabad" }
      ],
      "tags": ["places"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "note": "-లో (-loo) = 'in'. Telugu drops 'is' in simple sentences: మా ఇల్లు హైదరాబాదులో — 'our house (is) in Hyderabad'.",
      "distractors": ["u04-i05", "u04-i16"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u04-i07",
      "te": "మీరు ఎప్పుడు వస్తారు?",
      "gloss": "When will you come?",
      "words": [
        { "te": "మీరు", "gloss": "you (polite)" },
        { "te": "ఎప్పుడు", "gloss": "when" },
        { "te": "వస్తారు", "gloss": "will (you) come" }
      ],
      "tags": ["questions", "time"],
      "difficulty": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "u04-i08",
      "te": "రేపు వస్తాను.",
      "gloss": "I'll come tomorrow.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "రేపు", "gloss": "tomorrow" },
        { "te": "వస్తాను", "gloss": "I will come" }
      ],
      "tags": ["time"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "distractors": ["u04-i07", "u04-i10"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u04-i09",
      "te": "ఎందుకు రాలేదు?",
      "gloss": "Why didn't you come?",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఎందుకు", "gloss": "why" },
        { "te": "రాలేదు", "gloss": "didn't come" }
      ],
      "tags": ["questions"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "note": "Past negative is easy: వచ్చారు 'came' → రాలేదు 'didn't come'. One లేదు (leedu) fits every person."
    },
    {
      "id": "u04-i10",
      "te": "పని ఉంది.",
      "gloss": "I had work. (there is work)",
      "words": [
        { "te": "పని", "gloss": "work" },
        { "te": "ఉంది", "gloss": "there is" }
      ],
      "tags": ["smalltalk"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "note": "పని ఉంది (pani undi), literally 'there is work' — the universal Telugu excuse for everything.",
      "distractors": ["u04-i08", "u04-i09"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u04-i11",
      "te": "అక్కడికి ఎలా వెళ్ళాలి?",
      "gloss": "How do I get there?",
      "words": [
        { "te": "అక్కడికి", "gloss": "to there" },
        { "te": "ఎలా", "gloss": "how" },
        { "te": "వెళ్ళాలి", "gloss": "should (one) go" }
      ],
      "tags": ["questions", "places"],
      "difficulty": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "u04-i12",
      "te": "బస్సులో వెళ్ళండి.",
      "gloss": "Go by bus.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "బస్సులో", "gloss": "by bus" },
        { "te": "వెళ్ళండి", "gloss": "go (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["places", "commands"],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "note": "-లో also covers 'by' for transport: బస్సులో by bus, కారులో by car, ట్రైన్లో by train.",
      "distractors": ["u04-i11", "u04-i06"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u04-i13",
